{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48015","headline":"与独孤穆冥会诗 一 · 临淄县主","name":"与独孤穆冥会诗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江都昔丧乱，阙下多构兵。\n豺虎恣吞噬，干戈日纵横。\n逆徒自外至，半夜开重城。\n膏血浸宫殿，刀枪倚檐楹。\n今知从逆者，廼是公与卿。\n白刃汚黄屋，邦家遂因倾。\n疾风知劲草，世乱识忠臣。\n哀哀独孤公，临死乃结缨。\n天地既板荡，云雷时未亨。\n今者二百载，幽怀犹未平。\n山河风月古，陵寝露烟青。\n君子秉祖德，方垂忠烈名。\n华轩一惠顾，土室以爲荣。\n丈夫立志操，存没感其情。\n求义若可托，谁能抱幽贞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"临淄县主","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}